{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_1","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"◎歷四","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_2","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"○授時歷經下","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_3","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"步中星第五","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_4","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"大都北極，出地四十度太強。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_5","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"冬至，去極一百一十五度二十一分七十三秒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_6","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"夏至，去極六十七度四十一分一十三秒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_7","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"冬至晝，夏至夜，三千八百一十五分九十二秒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_8","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"夏至晝，冬至夜，六千一百八十四分八秒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_9","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"昏明，二百五十分。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_10","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"黃道出入赤道內外去極度及半晝夜分","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_11","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"（表略）","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_12","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求每日黃道出入赤道內外去極度","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_13","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置所求日晨前夜半黃道積度，滿半歲周，去之，在象限已下，為初限；已上，复减半歲周，餘為入末限；滿積度，去之，餘以其段內外差乘之，百約之，所得，用减內外度，為出入赤道內外度；內减外加象限，即所求去極度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_14","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求每日半晝夜及日出入晨昏分","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_15","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置所求入初末限，滿積度，去之，餘以晝夜差乘之，百約之，所得，加减其段半晝夜分，為所求日半晝夜分；）前多後少為减，前少後多為加。以半夜分便為日出分，用减日周，餘為日入分；以昏明分减日出分，餘為晨分；加日入分，為昏分。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_16","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求晝夜刻及日出入辰刻","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_17","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置半夜分，倍之，百約，為夜刻；以减百刻，餘為晝刻；以日出入分依發斂求之，即得所求辰刻。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_18","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求更點率","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_19","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置晨分，倍之，五約，為更率；又五約更率，為點率。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_20","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求更點所在辰刻","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_21","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置所求更點數，以更點率乘之，加其日昏分，依發斂求之，即得所求辰刻。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_22","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求距中度及更差度","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_23","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置半日周，以其日晨分减之，餘為距中分；以三百六十六度二十五分七十五秒乘之，如日周而一，所得，為距中度；用减一百八十三度一十二分八十七秒半，倍之，五除，為更差度及分。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_24","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求昏明五更中星","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_25","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置距中度，以其日午中赤道日度加而命之，即昏中星所臨宿次，命為初更中星；以更差度累加之，滿赤道宿次去之，為逐更及晓中星宿度及分秒。其九服所在晝夜刻分及中星諸率，併准隨處北極出地度數推之。（已上諸率，與晷漏所推自相符契。）","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_26","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求九服所在漏刻","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_27","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"各於所在以儀测验，或下水漏，以定其處冬至或夏至夜刻，與五十刻相减，餘為至差刻。置所求日黃道，去赤道內外度及分，以至差刻乘之，進一位，如二百三十九而一，所得內减外加五十刻，即所求夜刻；以减百刻，餘為晝刻。（其日出入辰刻及更點等率，依術求之。）","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_28","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"步交會第六","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_29","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"交終分，二十七萬二千一百二十二分二十四秒。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_30","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"交終，二十七日二千一百二十二分二十四秒。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_31","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"交中，十三日六千六十一分一十二秒。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_32","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"交差，二日三千一百八十三分六十九秒。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_33","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"交望，十四日七千六百五十二分九十六秒半。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_34","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"交應，二十六萬一百八十七分八十六秒。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_35","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"交終，三百六十三度七十九分三十四秒。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_36","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"交中，一百八十一度八十九分六十七秒。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_37","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"正交，三百五十七度六十四分。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_38","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"中交，一百八十八度五分。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_39","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"日食陽歷限，六度。定法，六十。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_40","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"陰歷限，八度。定法，八十。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_41","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"月食限，十三度五分。定法，八十七。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_42","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"推天正經朔入交","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_43","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置中積，加交應，减閏餘，滿交終分，去之；不盡，以日周約之為日，不滿為分秒，即天正經朔入交泛日及分秒。）上考者，中積內加所求閏餘，减交應，滿交終去之，不盡，以减交終，餘如上。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_44","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求次朔望入交","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_45","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置天正經朔入交泛日及分秒，以交望累加之，滿交終日，去之，即為次朔望入交泛日及分秒。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_46","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求定朔望及每日夜半入交","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_47","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"各置入交泛日及分秒，减去經朔望小餘，即為定朔望夜半入交。若定日有增損者，亦如之。否則因經為定，大月加二日，小月加一日，餘皆加七千八百七十七分七十六秒，即次朔夜半入交；累加一日，滿交終日，去之，即每日夜半入交泛日及分秒。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_48","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求定朔望加時入交","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_49","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置經朔望入交泛日及分秒，以定朔望加减差加减之，即定朔望加時入交日及分秒。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_50","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求交常交定度","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_51","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置經朔望入交泛日及分秒，以月平行度乘之，為交常度；以盈縮差盈加縮减之，為交定度。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_52","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求日月食甚定分","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_53","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"日食：视定朔分在半日周已下，去减半周，為中前；已上，减去半周，為中後；與半周相减、相乘，退二位，如九十六而一，為時差；中前以减，中後以加，皆加减定朔分，為食甚定分；以中前後分各加時差，為距午定分。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_54","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"月食：视定望分在日周四分之一已下，為卯前；已上，覆减半周，為卯後；在四分之三已下，减去半周，為酉前；已上，覆减日周，為酉後。以卯酉前後分自乘，退二位，如四百七十八而一，為時差；子前以减，子後以加，皆加减定望分，為食甚定分；各依發斂求之，即食甚辰刻。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_55","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求日月食甚入盈縮歷及日行定度","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_56","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置經朔望入盈縮歷日及分，以食甚日及定分加之，以經朔望日及分减之，即為食甚入盈縮歷；依日躔術求盈縮差，盈加縮减之，為食甚入盈縮歷定度。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_57","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求南北差","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_58","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"视日食甚入盈縮歷定度，在象限已下，為初限；已上，用减半歲周，為末限；以初末限度自相乘，如一千八百七十而一，為度，不滿，退除為分秒；用减四度四十六分，餘為南北泛差；以距午定分乘之，以半晝分除之，所得，以减泛差，為定差。泛差不及减者，反减之為定差，應加者减之，應减者加之。在盈初縮末者，交前陰歷减，陽歷加，交後陰歷加，陽歷减；在縮初盈末者，交前陰歷加，陽歷减，交後陰歷减，陽歷加。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_59","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求東西差","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_60","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"视日食甚入盈縮歷定度，與半歲周相减相乘，如一千八百七十而一，為度，不滿，退除為分秒，為東西泛差；以距午定分乘之，以日周四分之一除之，為定差。若在泛差已上者，倍泛差减之，餘為定差，依其加减。在盈中前者，交前陰歷减，陽歷加；交後陰歷加，陽歷减；中後者，交前陰歷加，陽歷减；交後陰歷减，陽歷加。在縮中前者，交前陰歷加，陽歷减；交後陰歷减，陽歷加；中後者，交前陰歷减，陽歷加；交後陰歷加，陽歷减。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_61","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求日食正交中交限度","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_62","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置正交、中交度，以南北東西差加减之，為正交、中交限度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_63","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求日食入陰陽歷去交前後度","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_64","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"视交定度，在中交限已下，以减中交限，為陽歷交前度；已上，减去中交限，為陰歷交後度；在正交限已下，以减正交限，為陰歷交前度；已上，减去正交限，為陽歷交後度。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_65","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求月食入陰陽歷去交前後度","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_66","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"视交定度，在交中度已下，為陽歷；已上，减去交中，為陰歷。视入陰陽歷，在後准十五度半已下，為交後度；前准一百六十六度三十九分六十八秒已上，覆减交中，餘為交前度及分。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_67","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求日食分秒","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_68","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"视去交前後度，各减陰陽歷食限，（不及减者不食。）餘如定法而一，各為日食之分秒。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_69","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求月食分秒","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_70","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"视去交前後度，）不用南北東西差者。用减食限，（不及减者不食。）餘如定法而一，為月食之分秒。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_71","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求日食定用及三限辰刻","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_72","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置日食分秒，與二十分相减、相乘，平方开之，所得，以五千七百四十乘之，如入定限行度而一，為定用分；以减食甚定分，為初虧；加食甚定分，為复圓；依發斂求之，為日食三限辰刻。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_73","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求月食定用及三限五限辰刻","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_74","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置月食分秒，與三十分相减、相乘，平方开之；所得，以五千七百四十乘之，如入定限行度而一，為定用分；以减食甚定分，為初虧；加食甚定分，為复圓；依發斂求之，即月食三限辰刻。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_75","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"月食既者，以既內分與一十分相减、相乘，平方开之，所得，以五千七百四十乘之，如入定限行度而一，為既內分；用减定用分，為既外分；以定用分减食甚定分，為初虧；加既外，為食既；又加既內，為食甚；再加既內，為生光；复加既外，為复圓；依發斂求之，即月食五限辰刻。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_76","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求月食入更點","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_77","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置食甚所入日晨分，倍之，五約，為更法；又五約更法，為點法。乃置初末諸分，昏分已上，减去昏分，晨分已下，加晨分，以更法除之，為更數；不滿，以點法收之，為點數；其更點數，命初更初點算外，各得所入更點。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_78","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求日食所起","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_79","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"食在陽歷，初起西南，甚於正南，复於東南；食在陰歷，初起西北，甚於正北，复於東北；食八分已上，初起正西，复於正東。（此據午地而論之。）","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_80","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求月食所起","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_81","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"食在陽歷，初起東北，甚於正北，复於西北；食在陰歷，初起東南，甚於正南，复於西南；食八分已上，初起正東，复於正西。（此亦據午地而論之。）","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_82","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求日月出入帶食所見分數","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_83","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"视其日日出入分，在初虧已上、食甚已下者，為帶食。各以食甚分與日出入分相减，餘為帶食差；以乘所食之分，滿定用分而一，（如月食既者，以既內分减帶食差，餘進一位，如既外分而一，所得，以减既分，即月帶食出入所見之分；不及减者，為帶食既出入。）以减所食分，即日月出入帶食所見之分。（其食甚在晝，晨為漸進，昏為已退；其食甚在夜，晨為已退，昏為漸進。）","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_84","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求日月食甚宿次","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_85","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置日月食甚入盈縮歷定度，在盈，便為定積；在縮，加半歲周，為定積。望即更加半周天度。以天正冬至加時黃道日度，加而命之，各得日月食甚宿次及分秒。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_86","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"步五星第七","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_87","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"歷度","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_88","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"三百六十五度二十五分七十五秒。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_89","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"歷中","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_90","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"一百八十二度六十二分八十七秒半。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_91","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"歷策","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_92","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"一十五度二十一分九十秒六十二微半。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_93","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"木星","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_94","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"周率，三百九十八萬八千八百分。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_95","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"周日，三百九十八日八十八分。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_96","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"歷率，四千三百三十一萬二千九百六十四分八十六秒半。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_97","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"度率，一十一萬八千五百八十二分。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_98","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"合應，一百一十七萬九千七百二十六分。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_99","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"歷應，一千八百九十九萬九千四百八十一分。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_100","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"盈縮立差，二百三十六加。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_101","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"平差，二萬五千九百一十二减。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_102","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"定差，一千八十九萬七千。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_103","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"伏見，一十三度。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_104","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"（表略）","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_105","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"火星","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_106","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"周率，七百七十九萬九千二百九十分。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_107","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"周日，七百七十九日九十二分九十秒。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_108","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"歷率，六百八十六萬九千五百八十分四十三秒。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_109","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"度率，一萬八千八百七分半。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_110","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"合應，五十六萬七千五百四十五分。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_111","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"歷應，五百四十七萬二千九百三十八分。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_112","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"盈初縮末立差，一千一百三十五减。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_113","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"平差，八十三萬一千一百八十九减。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_114","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"定差，八千八百四十七萬八千四百。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_115","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"縮初盈末立差，八百五十一加。","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_116","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"平差，三萬二百三十五負减。","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_117","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"定差，二千九百九十七萬六千三百。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_118","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"伏見，一十九度。","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_119","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"（表略）","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_120","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"土星","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_121","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"周率，三百七十八萬九百一十六分。","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_122","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"周日，三百七十八日九分一十六秒。","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_123","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"歷率，一亿七百四十七萬八千八百四十五分六十六秒。","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_124","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"度率，二十九萬四千二百五十五分。","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_125","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"合應，一十七萬五千六百四十三分。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_126","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"歷應，五千二百二十四萬五百六十一分。","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_127","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"盈立差，二百八十三加。","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_128","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"平差，四萬一千二十二减。","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_129","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"定差，一千五百一十四萬六千一百。","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_130","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"縮立差，三百三十一加。","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_131","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"平差，一萬五千一百二十六减。","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_132","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"定差，一千一百一萬七千五百。","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_133","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"伏見，一十八度。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_134","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"（表略）","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_135","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"金星","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_136","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"周率，五百八十三萬九千二十六分。","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_137","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"周日，五百八十三日九十分二十六秒。","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_138","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"歷率，三百六十五萬二千五百七十五分。","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_139","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"度率，一萬。","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_140","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"合應，五百七十一萬六千三百三十分。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_141","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"歷應，一十一萬九千六百三十九分。","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_142","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"盈縮立差，一百四十一加。","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_143","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"平差，三减。","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_144","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"定差，三百五十一萬五千五百。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_145","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"伏見，一十度半。","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_146","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"（表略）","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_147","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"水星","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_148","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"周率，一百一十五萬八千七百六十分。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_149","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"周日，一百一十五日八十七分六十秒。","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_150","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"歷率，三百六十五萬二千五百七十五分。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_151","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"度率，一萬。","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_152","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"合應，七十萬四百三十七分。","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_153","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"歷應，二百五萬五千一百六十一分。","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_154","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"盈縮立差，一百四十一加。","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_155","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"平差，二千一百六十五减。","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_156","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"定差，三百八十七萬七千。","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_157","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"晨伏夕見，一十六度半。","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_158","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"夕伏晨見，一十九度。","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_159","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"（表略）","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_160","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"推天正冬至後五星平合及諸段中積中星","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_161","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置中積，加合應，以其星周率去之，不盡，為前合；复减周率，餘為後合；以日周約之，得其星天正冬至後平合中積中星。）命為日，日中積；命為度，日中星。以段日累加中積，即諸段中積；以平度累加中星，經退則减之，即為諸段中星。）上考者，中積內减合應，滿周率去之，不盡，便為所求後合分。","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_162","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"推五星平合及諸段入歷","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_163","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"各置中積，加歷應及所求後合分，滿歷率，去之；不盡，如度率而一為度，不滿，退除為分秒，即其星平合入歷度及分秒；以諸段限度累加之，即諸段入歷。上考者，中積內减歷應，滿歷率去之，不盡，反减歷率，餘加其年後合，餘同上。","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_164","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求盈縮差","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_165","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置入歷度及分秒，在歷中已下，為盈；已上，减去歷中，餘為縮。视盈縮歷，在九十一度三十一分四十三秒太已下，為初限；已上，用减歷中，餘為末限。","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_166","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"其火星，盈歷在六十度八十七分六十二秒半已下，為初限；已上，用减歷中，餘為末限。","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_167","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置各星立差，以初末限乘之，去加减平差，得，又以初末限乘之，去加减定差，再以初末限乘之，滿亿為度，不滿退除為分秒，即所求盈縮差。","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_168","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"又術：置盈縮歷，以歷策除之，為策數，不盡為策餘；以其下損益率乘之，歷策除之，所得，益加損减其下盈縮積，亦為所求盈縮差。","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_169","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求平合諸段定積","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_170","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"各置其星其段中積，以其盈縮差盈加縮减之，即其段定積日及分秒；以天正冬至日分加之，滿紀法去之，不滿，命甲子算外，即得日辰。","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_171","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求平合及諸段所在月日","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_172","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"各置其段定積，以天正閏日及分加之，滿朔策，除之為月數，不盡，為入月已來日數及分秒。其月數，命天正十一月算外，即其段入月經朔日數及分秒；以日辰相距，為所在定朔月日。","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_173","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求平合及諸段加時定星","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_174","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"各置其段中星，以盈縮差盈加縮减之，（金星倍之，水星三之。）即諸段定星；以天正冬至加時黃道日度加而命之，即其星其段加時所在宿度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_175","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求諸段初日晨前夜半定星","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_176","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"各以其段初行率，乘其段加時分，百約之，乃順减退加其日加時定星，即其段初日晨前夜半定星；加命如前，即得所求。","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_177","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求諸段日率度率","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_178","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"各以其段日辰距後段日辰為日率，以其段夜半宿次與後段夜半宿次相减，餘為度率。","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_179","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求諸段平行分","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_180","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"各置其段度率，以其段日率除之，即其段平行度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_181","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求諸段增减差及日差","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_182","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"以本段前後平行分相减，為其段泛差；倍而退位，為增减差；以加减其段平行分，為初末日行分。）前多後少者，加為初，减為末；前少後多者，减為初，加為末。倍增减差，為總差；以日率减一，除之，為日差。","sentenceOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_183","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求前後伏遲退段增减差","sentenceOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_184","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"前伏者，置後段初日行分，加其日差之半，為末日行分。","sentenceOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_185","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"後伏者，置前段末日行分，加其日差之半，為初日行分；以减伏段平行分，餘為增减差。","sentenceOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_186","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"前遲者，置前段末日行分，倍其日差，减之，為初日行分。","sentenceOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_187","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"後遲者，置後段初日行分，倍其日差，减之，為末日行分；以遲段平行分减之，餘為增减差。）前後近留之遲段。","sentenceOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_188","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"木火土三星，退行者，六因平行分，退一位，為增减差。","sentenceOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_189","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"金星，前後退伏者，三因平行分，半而退位，為增减差。","sentenceOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_190","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"前退者，置後段初日行分，以其日差减之，為末日行分。","sentenceOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_191","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"後退者，置前段末日行分，以其日差减之，為初日行分；乃以本段平行分减之，餘為增减差。","sentenceOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_192","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"水星，退行者，半平行分，為增减差；皆以增减差加减平行分，為初末日行分。前多後少者，加為初，减為末；前少後多者，减為初，加為末。又倍增减差，為總差；以日率减一，除之，為日差。","sentenceOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_193","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求每日晨前夜半星行宿次","sentenceOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_194","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"各置其段初日行分，以日差累損益之，後少則損之，後多則益之，為每日行度及分秒；乃順加退减，滿宿次去之，即每日晨前夜半星行宿次。","sentenceOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_195","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求五星平合見伏入盈縮歷","sentenceOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_196","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"置其星其段定積日及分秒，（若滿歲周日及分秒，去之，餘在次年天正冬至後。）如在半歲周已下，為入盈歷；滿半歲周，去之，為入縮歷；各在初限已下，為初限；已上，反减半歲周，餘為末限；即得五星平合見伏入盈縮歷日及分秒。","sentenceOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_197","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求五星平合見伏行差","sentenceOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_198","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"各以其星其段初日星行分，與其段初日太陽行分相减，餘為行差。若金、水二星退行在退合者，以其段初日星行分，併其段初日太陽行分，為行差；內水星夕伏晨見者，直以其段初日太陽行分為行差。","sentenceOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_199","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求五星定合定見定伏泛積","sentenceOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_200","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"木火土三星，以平合晨見夕伏定積日，便為定合伏見泛積日及分秒。","sentenceOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_201","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"金水二星，置其段盈縮差度及分秒，（水星倍之。）各以其段行差除之，為日，不滿，退除為分秒。在平合夕見晨伏者，盈减縮加；在退合夕伏晨見者，盈加縮减；各以加减定積為定合伏見泛積日及分秒。","sentenceOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_202","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求五星定合定積定星","sentenceOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_203","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"木火土三星，各以平合行差除其段初日太陽盈縮積，為距合差日；不滿，退除為分秒，以太陽盈縮積减之，為距合差度。各置其星定合泛積，以距合差日盈减縮加之，為其星定合定積日及分秒；以距合差度盈减縮加之，為其星定合定星度及分秒。","sentenceOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_204","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"金水二星，順合退合者，各以平合退合行差，除其日太陽盈縮積，為距合差日；不滿，退除為分秒，順加退减太陽盈縮積，為距合差度。順合者，盈加縮减其星定合泛積，為其星定合定積日及分秒；退合者，以距合差日盈减縮加、距合差度盈加縮减其星退定合泛積，為其星退定合定積日及分秒；命之，為退定合定星度及分秒。以天正冬至日及分秒，加其星定合定積日及分秒，滿旬周，去之，命甲子算外，即得定合日辰及分秒。以天正冬至加時黃道日度及分秒，加其星定合定星度及分秒，滿黃道宿次，去之，即得定合所躔黃道宿度及分秒。（径求五星合伏定日：木、火、土三星，以夜半黃道日度，减其星夜半黃道宿次，餘在其日太陽行分已下，為其日伏合；金、水二星，以其星夜半黃道宿次，减夜半黃道日度，餘在其日金、水二星行分已下者，為其日伏合。金、水二星伏退合者，视其日太陽夜半黃道宿次，未行到金、水二星宿次，又视次日太陽行過金、水二星宿次，金、水二星退行過太陽宿次，為其日定合伏退定日。）","sentenceOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_205","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求木火土三星定見伏定積日","sentenceOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_206","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"各置其星定見定伏泛積日及分秒，晨加夕减九十一日三十一分六秒，如在半歲周已下，自相乘，已上，反减歲周，餘亦自相乘，滿七十五，除之為分，滿百為度，不滿，退除為秒；以其星見伏度乘之，一十五除之；所得，以其段行差除之，為日，不滿，退除為分秒；見加伏减泛積，為其星定見伏定積日及分秒；加命如前，即得定見定伏日辰及分秒。","sentenceOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_207","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"求金水二星定見伏定積日","sentenceOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_nguyen_su_55_208","chapterId":"ch_work_nguyen_su_55","textTraditional":"各以伏見日行差，除其段初日太陽盈縮積，為日，不滿，退除為分秒；若夕見晨伏，盈加縮减；如晨見夕伏，盈减縮加；以加减其星定見定伏泛積日及分秒，為常積。如在半歲周已下，為冬至後；已上，去之，餘為夏至後。各在九十一日三十一分六秒已下，自相乘，已上，反减半歲周，亦自相乘。冬至後晨，夏至後夕，一十八而一，為分；冬至後夕，夏至後晨，七十五而一，為分；又以其星見伏度乘之，一十五除之；所得，滿行差，除之，為日，不滿，退除為分秒，加减常積，為定積。在晨見夕伏者，冬至後加之，夏至後减之；夕見晨伏者，冬至後减之，夏至後加之；為其星定見定伏定積日及分秒；加命如前，即得定見定伏日晨及分秒。","sentenceOrder":208}],"overrides":{}}